# Backend Analysis & Complete API Inventory

**Target Application**: Enterprise Learning Management System (LMS)  
**Backend Framework**: FastAPI (Python 3.12) with SQLAlchemy 2.0, Alembic, MySQL 8.4 InnoDB  
**Authentication Standard**: HTTP Bearer (JWT HS256, 60m expiry), Argon2id password hashing  
**Base URL**: `http://127.0.0.1:8000` (CORS configured for `http://localhost:5173` and `http://127.0.0.1:5173`)  

---

## 1. Backend Architecture & Domain Models

### 1.1 Database Models & Entity-Relationship Overview
The database comprises **28 relational tables** mapped with strict foreign key constraints:
1. **User & Identity (`app/models/user.py`)**:
   - `roles`: `id`, `name` (`admin` | `instructor` | `student`), `description`
   - `users`: `id`, `role_id`, `full_name`, `email`, `password_hash`, `phone`, `avatar_url`, `is_active`, `last_login_at`, timestamps
   - `password_reset_tokens`: `id`, `user_id`, `token_hash`, `expires_at`, `used_at`
   - `instructors`: `id`, `user_id` (1:1), `employee_code` (`INS-YYYY-XXXX`), `expertise`, `qualification`, `bio`, `experience_years`
   - `students`: `id`, `user_id` (1:1), `student_code` (`STU-YYYY-XXXX`), `date_of_birth`, `address`, `guardian_name`, `guardian_phone`
2. **Curriculum & Courses (`app/models/course.py`)**:
   - `courses`: `id`, `course_code`, `name`, `description`, `category`, `duration_hours`, `fee`, `thumbnail_url`, `status` (`draft` | `published` | `archived`), `primary_instructor_id`
   - `course_instructors`: `course_id`, `instructor_id` (co-instructors)
   - `course_modules`: `id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `sequence_order`
3. **Batches & Rosters (`app/models/operations.py`)**:
   - `batches`: `id`, `batch_code`, `name`, `course_id`, `instructor_id`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `class_days`, `class_timing`, `capacity`, `status` (`upcoming` | `active` | `closed` | `archived`)
   - `batch_students`: `batch_id`, `student_id`, `status` (`active` | `dropped` | `completed`), `joined_at`
   - `enrollments`: `id`, `student_id`, `course_id`, `status` (`active` | `completed` | `dropped`), `enrolled_at`, `completed_at`
4. **Content & Delivery (`app/models/content.py`)**:
   - `lectures`: `id`, `course_id`, `module_id`, `title`, `description`, `sequence_order`, `video_url`, `video_file_name`, `video_file_size`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`
   - `study_materials`: `id`, `course_id`, `module_id`, `lecture_id`, `title`, `description`, `file_name`, `file_path`, `mime_type`, `file_size`, `uploaded_by`
   - `lecture_progress`: `id`, `student_id`, `lecture_id`, `is_completed`, `completed_at`
5. **Assessments (`app/models/assessment.py`)**:
   - `assignments`: `id`, `course_id`, `batch_id`, `title`, `instructions`, `attachment_name`, `attachment_path`, `max_marks`, `passing_marks`, `due_date`, `allow_late`, `created_by`
   - `submissions`: `id`, `assignment_id`, `student_id`, `version`, `submission_text`, `file_name`, `file_path`, `status` (`submitted` | `under_review` | `evaluated`), `is_late`, `submitted_at`
   - `assignment_feedback`: `id`, `submission_id`, `evaluator_id`, `marks_obtained`, `feedback_text`, `evaluated_at`
   - `quizzes`: `id`, `course_id`, `batch_id`, `title`, `description`, `total_marks`, `passing_marks`, `duration_minutes`, `available_from`, `available_until`, `allow_retakes`, `max_attempts`, `show_correct_answers`, `is_published`
   - `questions`: `id`, `quiz_id`, `question_text`, `marks`, `sequence_order`
   - `quiz_options`: `id`, `question_id`, `option_text`, `is_correct`, `sequence_order`
   - `quiz_attempts`: `id`, `quiz_id`, `student_id`, `attempt_number`, `started_at`, `expires_at`, `submitted_at`, `status`, `score`, `is_passed`
   - `quiz_answers`: `id`, `attempt_id`, `question_id`, `selected_option_id`, `is_correct`, `marks_awarded`
6. **Operations, Finance & Certification (`app/models/operations.py`)**:
   - `attendance`: `id`, `batch_id`, `student_id`, `session_date`, `status` (`present` | `absent` | `cancelled` | `holiday` | `approved_leave`), `remarks`, `marked_by`, `updated_by`
   - `attendance_audit_logs`: `id`, `attendance_id`, `old_status`, `new_status`, `changed_by`, `reason`, `changed_at`
   - `certificates`: `id`, `student_id`, `course_id`, `certificate_number`, `verification_code`, `issue_date`, `pdf_path`
   - `payments`: `id`, `receipt_number`, `student_id`, `course_id`, `enrollment_id`, `amount_paid`, `payment_method` (`cash` | `card` | `bank_transfer` | `upi` | `online`), `transaction_ref`, `status` (`paid` | `partially_paid` | `pending` | `refunded`), `payment_date`, `notes`, `recorded_by`
   - `notifications`: `id`, `user_id`, `title`, `message`, `event_type`, `reference_type`, `reference_id`, `is_read`, `read_at`
   - `announcements`: `id`, `title`, `content`, `target_role` (`all` | `admin` | `instructor` | `student`), `course_id`, `batch_id`, `created_by`, `published_at`

