## 2. Standard Request & Response Envelopes

### 2.1 Pagination Format (`PaginatedResponse[T]`)
```json
{
  "items": [ ... ],
  "total": 45,
  "page": 1,
  "page_size": 20,
  "total_pages": 3
}
```
Standard query parameters: `page` (int $\ge 1$, default 1), `page_size` (int $1 \dots 100$, default 20), `sort_by` (string, default `"created_at"`), `sort_order` (`"asc"` | `"desc"`, default `"desc"`).

### 2.2 Error Envelope (`ErrorResponse`)
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS",
    "message": "Invalid email or password.",
    "details": null
  }
}
```
Standard HTTP status codes: `400 Bad Request`, `401 Unauthorized`, `403 Forbidden`, `404 Not Found`, `409 Conflict`, `422 Unprocessable Entity`, `429 Too Many Requests`.

